    "true_color": "The rendering is generally dark. Water is deep blue to nearly black, woody cover is dark green and olive, and narrow lower-center and eastern bands are brighter green. Several openings and shore patches are gray, tan or muted brown. These color observations have high confidence; material assignments have medium confidence.",
